# SmithtownMap — Authoritative Facts Ledger (canonical, CI-ratified).
#
# Each fact is a testable claim: when its `command` exits 0, the claim is true.
# Lifecycle: spec (in .facts.staging) -> implemented (promoted here).
# WRITE ONLY via the facts-bot CI ratification (.github/workflows/promote-facts.yml)
# or `bun run facts:promote <id>`. NEVER hand-edit (protect-facts hook + Layer-4 trust
# boundary). No fact is ever removed.
#
# ## domain (vocabulary — read first)
#   record            — one archival object (photo, document, artifact) from PastPerfect.
#   normalized-record — a record mapped into the ArchiveRecord schema (Scaffold §3e).
#   collection        — a curated grouping of records (Scaffold §11).
#   etl               — the PastPerfect -> SmithtownMap ingest pipeline (Scaffold §2).
#   geocode           — lat/lng + confidence assigned to a record's place (Scaffold §9).
#   gazetteer         — the local Long Island historical place-name table (Scaffold §9c).
#   tag-schema        — controlled vocabulary: Dublin Core / VRA Core / Getty AAT (Scaffold §3).
#   facet             — a filterable search dimension (Scaffold §7b).
#   cluster           — a map marker aggregating nearby records (Scaffold §4b).
#
# Stack note: where the Scaffold names Elasticsearch / Next.js / Leaflet, REPORT_AUDIT.txt
# supersedes it with Typesense / SvelteKit / MapLibre. Fact labels cite the Scaffold for
# INTENT and add [Audit: …] where the realization differs.
#
# Facts are appended below this header by the promotion pipeline. (Empty: greenfield —
# every Phase-1 claim currently lives in .facts.staging as @spec, RED.)
